  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_01",
      "hash64": "078D6045277CD5A9",
      "text": "身为宝可梦训练家！\\n我向往着“最强”这个词语啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_02",
      "hash64": "078D5D45277CD090",
      "text": "真希望有一天我能看到\\n持有最强之证的宝可梦啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_03",
      "hash64": "078D5E45277CD243",
      "text": "因为不是能随便碰上的，\\n所以是最强啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_04",
      "hash64": "078D6345277CDAC2",
      "text": "这只宝可梦……\\n并没持有最强之证啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_05",
      "hash64": "078D6445277CDC75",
      "text": "这只宝可梦……\\n是最强的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_06",
      "hash64": "078D6145277CD75C",
      "text": "哦哦哦……真厉害啊～！\\n真让人向往啊～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_07",
      "hash64": "078D6245277CD90F",
      "text": "让我教你在伽勒尔地区很流行的\\n最强动作来答谢你吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_system_01",
      "hash64": "A543D85A3529B876",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]从男孩那里\\n学会了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]喷火龙姿势动作[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
